Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:13.70,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's title number six for Diana Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德拿下生涯第六冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:17.32,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Champion in Tokyo,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N东京冠军 施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:25.45,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}after a fabulous final between two remarkable competitors.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两位出色球员献上精彩决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.81,0:00:27.94,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}1{\fs68}日上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.82,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}东京站女单决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施奈德先胜萨斯诺维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.53,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}再过伊埃拉这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:35.88,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}半决赛击败波汉科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这是她本赛季第一次决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:39.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}冠军近在眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:42.68,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}却还要闯过费尔南德斯这一关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:44.73,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.73,0:00:47.13,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第一次发球胜盘却没成功
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.13,0:00:48.63,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}对手追到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.89,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施奈德必须再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:55.15,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}All right.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:26.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, she'll be delighted, Diana Shnaider,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德会很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:31.80,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}if she was able to get things back on track after just a little blip.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在小波折后重回正轨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.60,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She first tried to serve out the set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她曾尝试发球拿下这一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:37.16,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She does at the second attempt.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二次 她做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:39.24,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Wins the first by six games to four.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.24,0:01:42.46,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's one set away from becoming the champion in Tokyo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N距离东京冠军 她还差一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.73,0:01:45.58,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘 施奈德继续向前施压
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:47.15,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她要把比分上的优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:49.33,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}变成场上的主动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.65,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}看这一拍 施奈德先把对手压在底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.65,0:01:54.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}再跟进网前截击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.56,0:01:56.10,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她主动缩短回合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:58.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}要把领先的优势继续扩大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:00.91,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}不给对手轻松调整的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:05.42,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 冠军只差两局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}可费尔南德斯没有退让
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:10.42,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这场决赛的转折 从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:38.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah. Well, she does break.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 费尔南德斯完成破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:59.09,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that might be the point of the match so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可能是全场目前最精彩的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:01.34,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施奈德仍以{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:03.83,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}但费尔南德斯连赢最后{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.75,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:09.18,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}已经靠近奖杯 她又被拉回起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:28.52,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just took out a little bit of frustration on that one, didn't she?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一拍 她释放了一些郁闷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.92,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Has three set points.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在有三个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:41.04,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that is a staggering comeback from Leylah Fernandez,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费尔南德斯完成惊人反扑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:45.17,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}who will have all the momentum heading into the deciding set of this final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她带着这股势头进入决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:47.30,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}决胜盘首次发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.30,0:03:49.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}施奈德{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:51.20,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}面对压到网前的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她用穿越球化解危机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:56.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}这一局 她连救{\fs78}3{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.81,0:03:59.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}顶住这次危机之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.42,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}起 施奈德连赢{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.42,0:04:05.08,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}全场{\fs78}8{\fs68}次破发机会 她抓住{\fs78}6{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.26,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}终于把冠军拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:20.76,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's title number six for Diana Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德拿下生涯第六冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:24.38,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Champion in Tokyo,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N东京冠军 施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.38,0:04:32.51,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}after a fabulous final between two remarkable competitors.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两位出色球员献上精彩决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:40.54,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Relief and delight at the end of a slightly frustrating{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N有些遗憾之后 是释然与喜悦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:46.96,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}season for Diana Shnaider. Her first final of the year and it ends in another trophy lift.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛季首次决赛 她以夺冠收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.96,0:04:52.06,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Shnaider winning in three, 6-4, 5-7, 6-2.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N施奈德{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:57.86,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We now move into the winner speech from champion Diana Shnaider.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N接下来是冠军施奈德的感言
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:04:59.44,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}丢掉一盘之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:02.02,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}重新把比赛赢回来 现在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:05.48,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}她终于可以接过属于自己的奖盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:17.00,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Please give another huge round of applause to the champion Diana Shnaider{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N掌声送给冠军施奈德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:20.48,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and runner-up Leylah Fernandez.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以及亚军费尔南德斯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:22.73,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}从{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先后丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:24.56,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}到{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}保住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:25.43,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}哪一分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.43,0:05:28.83,TL,,0,0,304,,{\an2}最能代表施奈德这条夺冠之路？
